e of thyroid function (PubMed:31372509). Although it is an anion channel, according to PubMed:12736153 and PubMed:32119864 it has been shown to exhibit chloride-bicarbonate exchanger activity."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}